Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.212.27.87","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79782,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b4493c92975c7307888b6bba5388ca4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have any brides recently had a wedding at Sandos Caracol? If so how was it? Any issues? how was the resort? DJ, Photographer, that sort of thing. We&#039;ve booked Sandos for our upcoming wedding in Sept. Mostly good reviews, some negative. But mostly negative are complain about small things, like bugs, or animals freely walking around the resort. I&#039;m not too concerned with things like this. That is why we picked the resort. Any help would be appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908131,"PostDate":1449284175,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>Have any brides recently had a wedding at Sandos Caracol? If so how was it? Any issues? how was the resort? DJ, Photographer, that sort of thing. We've booked Sandos for our upcoming wedding in Sept. Mostly good reviews, some negative. But mostly negative are complain about small things, like bugs, or animals freely walking around the resort. I'm not too concerned with things like this. That is why we picked the resort. Any help would be appreciated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"incubus42088@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.212.27.87","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449282484,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Incubus42088","Id":285524,"Name":"Incubus42088","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79782,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cbd91b569157bc88725bb811a2d2b89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! Congrats and welcome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you tried a search up top to see what forums come up for your resort? As well, there is the Resort Reviews section that you can look through to see what past brides have said.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908180,"PostDate":1449521441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! Congrats and welcome!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you tried a search up top to see what forums come up for your resort? As well, there is the Resort Reviews section that you can look through to see what past brides have said.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"179.53.128.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79782,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c109944582203c7c927ab2e34cc3bd8d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your upcoming dw, Incubus42088, and welcome to these boards!!! acw271011has great advice.....in case you haven&#039;t already seen them, here&#039;s a link to some threads here about your resort: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=171738e9eef3f7b9ee9da5624ce548bf&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=Sandos%20Caracol&#039;&gt;Sandos Caracol threads&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured, taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153497660869487.1073741944.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Sandos Cancun Wedding Album.&lt;\/a&gt;...for some further inspiration - enjoy!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/11807287_10153497661619487_6769359083079601319_o.jpg\" alt=\"11807287_10153497661619487_6769359083079\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11224680_10153497663129487_8316137592745935398_o.jpg\" alt=\"11224680_10153497663129487_8316137592745\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11059596_10153497665489487_1808125319350529659_o.jpg\" alt=\"11059596_10153497665489487_1808125319350\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908250,"PostDate":1449679108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your upcoming dw, Incubus42088, and welcome to these boards!!! acw271011has great advice.....in case you haven't already seen them, here's a link to some threads here about your resort: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=171738e9eef3f7b9ee9da5624ce548bf&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=Sandos%20Caracol' class='bbc_url' title=''>Sandos Caracol threads<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured, taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153497660869487.1073741944.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sandos Cancun Wedding Album.<\/a>...for some further inspiration - enjoy!!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/11807287_10153497661619487_6769359083079601319_o.jpg\" alt=\"11807287_10153497661619487_6769359083079\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11224680_10153497663129487_8316137592745935398_o.jpg\" alt=\"11224680_10153497663129487_8316137592745\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11059596_10153497665489487_1808125319350529659_o.jpg\" alt=\"11059596_10153497665489487_1808125319350\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79782,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d5df850db5a108b483a175596666a8d","RawContent":"I have decided to have my Dec 2016 wedding there!  Did you choose this one?  I was a little hesitant top, but my travel agent says the wedding planner is excellent there.\n\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909972,"PostDate":1453675994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have decided to have my Dec 2016 wedding there!  Did you choose this one?  I was a little hesitant top, but my travel agent says the wedding planner is excellent there.<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpenner@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1451963669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285764.jpg?_r=1451960071","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tpenner","Id":285764,"Name":"tpenner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.112.155.159","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79782,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40b6a4821f4ec6baaf3be139c1a162b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hello we&#039;ve also booked Sandos Caracol for our wedding January 2017. How is the planning coming along for you? Which package did you go with? Have you chosen many details yet?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers Kelsey&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911587,"PostDate":1457195165,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    fo